      <li><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/claude/sonnet">Claude Sonnet</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/claude-sonnet-5-5-system-card">Claude Sonnet 5.5 System Card</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://www.anthropic.com/claude-haiku-5-5">Introducing Claude Haiku 5.5</a> (Sonnet 5.5 cache-read price cut, 7 Oct 2026)</li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
